          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Find an expression that&#x27;s equal to <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\sqrt{5w^3} \\cdot \\sqrt{uv}]</span> by combining the radicals.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Find an expression that's equal to [MATH: \\sqrt{5w^3} \\cdot \\sqrt{uv}] by combining the radicals.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We apply the product rule for radicals, as follows:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: sqrt(5w^{3}) \u22c5 sqrt(uv)|=; sqrt(5w^{3} \u22c5 uv)|=; sqrt(5uvw^{3})]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We apply the product rule for radicals, as follows:\n\n[MATH: sqrt(5w^{3}) \u22c5 sqrt(uv)|=; sqrt(5w^{3} \u22c5 uv)|=; sqrt(5uvw^{3})]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFind an expression that's equal to [MATH: \\sqrt{5w^3} \\cdot \\sqrt{uv}] by combining the radicals.\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe apply the product rule for radicals, as follows:\n\n[MATH: sqrt(5w^{3}) \u22c5 sqrt(uv)|=; sqrt(5w^{3} \u22c5 uv)|=; sqrt(5uvw^{3})]"
      },
